# BuildKit reads this one, not .dockerignore, for Dockerfile.remote-nodes. The
# image needs the hub, the bridge, the web page and what they import, and
# nothing of the panel's own web page, docs or installers.

.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
bin
data
docs
web-panel
third_party
**/.DS_Store

# build output and tools' leftovers, which the build makes for itself
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# tests and their data: no build here runs them, and a change to one
# shouldn't rebuild the binaries
**/*_test.go
**/testdata

# the geoip data is 18 MB and nothing the hub or the bridge links embeds it
pkg/geofiles/embedded/*.dat
